Package: emeans
Title: Unsupervised Subtyping of Expression Data with e-Means
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dingkang", "Zhao", email = "dingkang.25@intl.zju.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Unsupervised molecular subtyping of bulk expression data.
    Samples are clustered with e-means, a k-means variant with exponentially
    averaged centroids, annealed step sizes and dead-cluster revival.
    Imputation, z-scores and PCA are built in; one call returns subtype
    labels, centroids, silhouette diagnostics, the k scan, markers and a
    predictor.
